WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.183 --> 00:00:02.766
(upbeat music)

00:00:16.590 --> 00:00:18.553
- Rex is a really good boy.

00:00:18.920 --> 00:00:20.590
- This is Pixel right here.

00:00:20.590 --> 00:00:21.823
She's a little corgi.

00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:23.073
And this is Tuk.

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.763
- This is Lou Reed, we call him Louie.

00:00:32.600 --> 00:00:35.243
I actually hope he's gonna
go for the cheapest food,

00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:37.883
but I feel like it's luck of the draw.

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:45.933
- He's not a picky eater at all.

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.610
He's literally eaten poop.

00:00:49.610 --> 00:00:51.290
- They're gonna go cuckoo over being able

00:00:51.290 --> 00:00:54.040
to actually eat something
other than their normal food.

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:58.070
- I've never seen him stop eating.

00:00:59.980 --> 00:01:02.580
And I've never seen him
choose not to eat something.

00:01:05.751 --> 00:01:08.334
(upbeat music)

00:01:20.211 --> 00:01:22.878
(dish clanking)

00:01:29.907 --> 00:01:32.574
(dish clanking)

00:01:40.191 --> 00:01:43.691
(dish dropping to ground)

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:52.563
- Tuk went straight
for the expensive food.

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:59.570
Pixel immediately goes
for the medium grade dish.

00:01:59.770 --> 00:02:03.320
Then goes for the very expensive stuff,

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:08.320
but seems to be very interested
in the medium grade food.

00:02:09.750 --> 00:02:11.870
- So Rex just goes straight
for the expensive food,

00:02:11.870 --> 00:02:14.933
no hesitation, he just
sucks it up super quick.

00:02:15.151 --> 00:02:17.240
Then goes to the medium one,

00:02:17.240 --> 00:02:18.810
then he slows down a little bit,

00:02:18.810 --> 00:02:20.840
leaves some left and then
goes to the third one,

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:22.610
he's losing some steam,
but he's still going,

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:24.340
he's still chomping down, but yeah,

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:27.423
it seems like he really really
likes the expensive one.

00:02:29.936 --> 00:02:30.769
(sighing)

00:02:30.769 --> 00:02:31.653
- I'm unhappy.

00:02:31.890 --> 00:02:33.260
I mean we named him Lou Reed.

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:35.083
We know he expects a lot.

00:02:35.570 --> 00:02:38.623
He's gonna still live with
low to medium priced food.

